 "notes": "Juno-106 panel, five voices (the original has six; Hera 6 XL plays six in the browser). MIDI CC 64 is the hold pedal; Output sets volume. Poly 2 steals when all voices are busy. HPF 2/3 and chorus II settings are approximated by ear. Patch shift, tape, memory and the MIDI function switch are hardware or storage, not reproduced."
